239	/// Builds the list of package names shown in the interactive multiselect wizard.
240	///
241	/// Uses `.display_name()` so that packages sharing a bare name across different
242	/// ecosystems (e.g. `cargo/foo` and `npm/foo`) appear as distinct, qualified
243	/// entries in the list rather than two identical `"foo"` rows.
244	fn collect_package_names<'a>(
