193	    /// Detection priority: pnpm > yarn > bun > npm (default).
194	    ///
195	    /// | Lockfile present   | Program | Base args                                    |
196	    /// |--------------------|---------|----------------------------------------------|
197	    /// | `pnpm-lock.yaml`   | `pnpm`  | `publish --filter <name>`                    |
198	    /// | `yarn.lock`        | `yarn`  | `workspace <name> npm publish`               |
199	    /// | `bun.lockb`        | `bun`   | `publish`                                    |
200	    /// | (none)             | `npm`   | `publish --workspace <name>`                 |
