262	    /// - `access`: when `Some(NpmAccess::Public)`, appends `--access public`;
263	    ///   when `Some(NpmAccess::Restricted)`, appends `--access restricted`;
264	    ///   when `None`, omits `--access` entirely so the package manager applies
265	    ///   its ecosystem default (`restricted` for `@scoped/packages`, `public`
266	    ///   for unscoped).
