307	    ///   appears to already exist"` for files already on the index; any such
308	    ///   mention yields [`PublishOutcome::AlreadyPublished`].
309	    /// - A clean zero-exit with no skip message yields [`PublishOutcome::Published`].
310	    /// - Rate-limit and auth-failure signals in the output map to the
311	    ///   corresponding [`RegistryError`] variants; everything else becomes
312	    ///   [`RegistryError::Other`].
